// Visible draft notice on every legal page until a New York attorney has
// reviewed it (PRD V-10). Remove it from a page only after that review.
---
<p class="legal-draft" role="note"><strong>Draft.</strong> This policy is pending review by a New York attorney and may change before it is final.</p>

<style>
  .legal-draft { border: 1px solid var(--line-mid); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); font-size: 15px; }
</style>
